<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44682" root="&#xA;                        وقع&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ الأَمْرَ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيقَاعٌ</span>, (with which
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْقِيعٌ</span></b>  is syn., as is shown in the TA,) <i>He made
the thing,</i> or <i>affair, to happen, to take place, to
come to pass,</i> or <i>to become executed</i> or <i>performed</i>
or <i>realized.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَهُ</span>
                        <i>He caused him to fall into
a snare,</i> or <i>the like; he ensnared him.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِمْ</span>: see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ فِيهِمْ شَرًّا</span>
                        <i>He caused evil to
befall them; occasioned them evil.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ بِهِ</span>
[<i>He punished him</i>]. (A, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عذر</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  See 1.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ فِى قَلْبِهِ</span>
                        <i>He put into his heart,</i> or
<i>mind.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b8-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ بَيْنَ القَوْمِ</span>, (L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أرش</span>,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ بَيْنَهُمُ الشَّرَّ</span> (TA, in that art.) <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَّشَ</span>. (L,
TA, in that art.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b9-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْقَعَ</span>
                        <i>He made</i> a verb <i>transitive.</i>
                    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
